Friend Function ▪In C++ a Friend Function  that is a "friend" of a given class is allowed 
access to private and protected data in that class. 
▪A friend function is a function which is declared using friend  keyword. 
class A
{
  private: 
    int numA;
  public : 
   void setA(); 
    
 };Class 
class B
{
  private: 
    int numB;
   public : 
    void  setB(); 
};Class 
void add() 
{ 
} Friend Function 
Access 
numA, numB friend void add(); friend void add(); 

